WEBVTT

00:02.660 --> 00:03.380
Dear Mother,

00:04.020 --> 00:08.440
Thanks to Keith and Harvey, Francis was proven to not be the Black Rose.

00:09.600 --> 00:11.890
But I, not knowing this...

00:12.590 --> 00:14.290
I snuck into Herman's mansion...

00:14.910 --> 00:16.190
And was captured.

00:26.790 --> 00:27.950
NAAJA

00:26.790 --> 00:27.950
Nadja

00:27.980 --> 00:30.450
kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:28.000 --> 00:30.450
With your eyes

00:30.450 --> 00:31.610
NAAJA

00:30.500 --> 00:31.610
Nadja

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
nani ga mieru

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:34.100 --> 00:36.990
haruka tooku hikaru

00:34.100 --> 00:36.990
Shining in the far distance,

00:37.140 --> 00:39.280
mirai no tobira

00:37.140 --> 00:39.280
The door to the future,

00:40.420 --> 00:43.830
sagashiteiru

00:40.420 --> 00:43.830
That's what I'm searching for

00:43.830 --> 00:51.040
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.750 --> 00:55.160
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:55.260 --> 00:58.520
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

00:55.260 --> 00:58.520
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:58.590 --> 01:01.970
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

00:58.620 --> 01:01.970
It could be so much more fun

01:02.000 --> 01:05.450
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:02.000 --> 01:05.450
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:05.820 --> 01:09.180
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:05.820 --> 01:09.180
I can't see the end of the journey

01:09.210 --> 01:12.370
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:09.210 --> 01:12.370
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:12.540 --> 01:16.190
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:12.540 --> 01:16.190
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:16.190 --> 01:18.340
te wo furinagara

01:16.190 --> 01:18.340
I will go waving

01:18.490 --> 01:25.230
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:18.490 --> 01:25.230
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:25.230 --> 01:27.970
ushiro mukanai

01:25.230 --> 01:27.970
But I won't look back

01:28.240 --> 01:33.280
yume ga kanau hima de

01:28.240 --> 01:33.280
Until the day my dream comes true

01:33.450 --> 01:36.830
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

01:33.450 --> 01:36.830
Nadja, your smile

01:36.910 --> 01:40.110
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:36.910 --> 01:40.110
Nadja, you give me courage

01:40.410 --> 01:43.370
aoi sora no shita de

01:40.410 --> 01:43.370
Under the blue sky

01:43.350 --> 01:46.160
ashita no yukue

01:43.350 --> 01:46.160
I will find the place

01:46.680 --> 01:50.310
mitsu kerukara

01:46.680 --> 01:50.310
Where my future lies

02:10.150 --> 02:10.740
Morning...

02:19.060 --> 02:20.870
If I can reach up there, I can get out!

02:21.160 --> 02:22.820
It's useless. Give it up.

02:25.260 --> 02:27.260
It's impossible to escape here.

02:27.680 --> 02:31.060
The only one who could get out of here was the Black Rose.

02:31.680 --> 02:32.420
The Black Rose?

02:38.190 --> 02:42.640
Don't Give Up! The Power of Truth

02:43.230 --> 02:44.210
What do you mean?

02:44.390 --> 02:46.160
The Black Rose was here too?

02:46.410 --> 02:46.950
Yes.

02:47.320 --> 02:50.340
When he snuck into the mansion and got caught.

02:50.830 --> 02:54.060
Was that when he got my brooch back?

02:54.460 --> 02:56.160
What, you already knew?

02:57.270 --> 02:58.580
Here, Keith was also...

03:00.010 --> 03:03.120
He wasn't just locked up.

03:03.720 --> 03:07.370
He was also brought here to be whipped thoroughly by Herman.

03:07.890 --> 03:08.680
What?

03:09.300 --> 03:11.760
He was covered in wounds.

03:11.860 --> 03:14.110
Hey, don't say unnecessary things!

03:15.570 --> 03:17.270
To get back my brooch...

03:17.760 --> 03:19.050
Keith went through that...

03:21.120 --> 03:25.240
And...for Keith, Francis is in prison.

03:26.450 --> 03:27.860
I also have to do my best.

03:28.030 --> 03:32.060
I have to get out of here and let everyone know what Herman is plotting.

03:33.420 --> 03:35.020
The Black Rose escaped from here, right?

03:35.370 --> 03:36.530
Huh...? Yeah.

03:37.020 --> 03:39.410
Then we can also escape, right?

03:40.180 --> 03:44.920
The Black Rose got away because he was able to beguile me.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.920
Is that something to be proud of?

03:47.170 --> 03:51.980
But we were able to get out of the pyramid because we combined our powers together.

03:52.330 --> 03:54.030
Back then it was thanks to that cat.

03:55.070 --> 03:55.680
But...

03:56.030 --> 03:58.970
Nadja, don't put yourself with us.

03:59.290 --> 03:59.660
Huh?

04:00.330 --> 04:03.630
I have a bargaining chip I can use against that guy.

04:04.000 --> 04:04.870
Bargaining chip?

04:05.160 --> 04:07.160
Eh? What is it? Tell me.

04:07.730 --> 04:09.660
It has nothing to do with you.

04:10.690 --> 04:11.730
Fine!

04:11.730 --> 04:13.480
I will do my best alone.

04:14.100 --> 04:15.090
Damn it!

04:15.580 --> 04:19.530
The Black Rose was really someone else.

04:20.570 --> 04:21.240
This is bad.

04:21.410 --> 04:25.210
Now that Francis is innocent, things have become worse.

04:25.980 --> 04:26.960
It was those two!

04:27.510 --> 04:32.960
They followed me from England to Egypt and stole my brooch.

04:33.950 --> 04:35.210
By the order of that man.

04:36.390 --> 04:40.520
Then let's ask the people from the orphanage who know Nadja from back then.

04:40.910 --> 04:44.740
You can bring testimony from these people?

04:45.260 --> 04:46.150
That time...

04:46.320 --> 04:48.150
I got away with it because...

04:51.130 --> 04:52.340
We are from the police.

04:52.470 --> 04:54.070
I-it's that man!

04:55.230 --> 04:56.710
The Black Rose!

04:58.370 --> 05:03.230
Francis was arrested right before Father's eyes and lost all credibility.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.550
If that was a mistake...

05:05.970 --> 05:09.650
If it's father...make no mistake, he will start investigations again.

05:10.070 --> 05:11.600
If it comes to that...

05:12.390 --> 05:13.450
Damn it!

05:19.030 --> 05:20.390
I'm ruined!

05:20.950 --> 05:23.420
If you are ruined it will be troublesome.

05:23.840 --> 05:25.650
What is it? Coming in here as you please...

05:26.020 --> 05:28.090
I've come to have you settle your debt.

05:28.610 --> 05:32.240
You said to wait one more day, right?

05:32.950 --> 05:34.110
I know that!

05:41.270 --> 05:42.900
G-good morning, Oscar.

05:43.220 --> 05:44.700
I'm sorry about yesterday.

05:45.120 --> 05:47.250
I was just flustered at the time.

05:47.740 --> 05:49.070
I have reflected upon it.

05:49.200 --> 05:51.590
T-the thing I want to discuss is...

05:51.860 --> 05:54.010
The plantation in France you mentioned yesterday...

05:55.000 --> 05:58.430
Can you put up a mortgage and raise some money?

05:58.550 --> 06:00.430
Of course, I will pay it back at once...

06:01.760 --> 06:05.370
If you leave this house, I will give you the money any time.

06:05.710 --> 06:06.160
But...

06:06.380 --> 06:08.210
I am Hilda's husband.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.470
For me to leave...

06:11.190 --> 06:11.740
Hilda!

06:12.550 --> 06:15.090
I...do not wish to see you anymore.

06:16.210 --> 06:17.000
What?

06:17.270 --> 06:19.710
Hilda! What do you think you're saying?

06:24.480 --> 06:27.170
Um...there is a guest for the master.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.710
Who could it be so early in the morning?

06:35.040 --> 06:35.960
Master Herman.

06:36.300 --> 06:39.950
Duke Preminger has something important to discuss with you.

06:43.240 --> 06:45.900
Please come to the mansion at two o'clock.

06:51.800 --> 06:52.740
I'm ruined.

06:53.380 --> 06:55.460
To be ruined in such a way...

06:56.400 --> 07:00.170
But...there is still a way to overcome Father.

07:00.490 --> 07:05.040
I'll be fine if I get rid of the people who know of my crime.

07:12.250 --> 07:13.180
This time...

07:15.360 --> 07:16.760
Haven't given up yet?

07:17.040 --> 07:18.050
Why do you go so far...

07:19.030 --> 07:21.920
Because...if I give up here, then it's over...

07:23.730 --> 07:25.600
What an unbelievable child.

07:26.100 --> 07:27.750
It was the same when you searched for your mother.

07:28.220 --> 07:29.430
Being troubled by us and Herman...

07:29.700 --> 07:31.430
Even your friend Rosemary...

07:31.650 --> 07:33.130
A normal person...

07:34.090 --> 07:36.040
Would have already have given up.

07:37.580 --> 07:43.770
When I was small, the chairwoman always said this to me when I was hurt or crying...

07:45.200 --> 07:45.890
Nadja...

07:46.440 --> 07:49.570
You feel miserable, like everything is pitch-black, right?

07:50.090 --> 07:52.760
But you know, there is no night that lasts forever.

07:53.470 --> 07:56.660
Beyond the night, a morning will always be there.

07:57.050 --> 07:58.240
A tomorrow will be there.

07:58.930 --> 08:00.780
Therefore, you can't give up.

08:01.350 --> 08:03.300
Even if it hurts or you are full of sorrow.

08:03.870 --> 08:06.060
Always believe in tomorrow.

08:07.640 --> 08:09.720
Therefore, I will not give up.

08:12.160 --> 08:12.930
So simplistic.

08:13.420 --> 08:14.530
Amazing...

08:14.850 --> 08:18.410
Brother, let's get out of here with Nadja.

08:18.610 --> 08:19.890
We can't get out.

08:21.440 --> 08:23.670
You can't get through the window unless you are a child.

08:23.910 --> 08:25.250
T-that can't be!

08:27.670 --> 08:28.700
Hey, Nadja!

08:29.390 --> 08:32.010
I really hate your way of thinking.

08:32.330 --> 08:33.270
I think it's stupid.

08:34.010 --> 08:38.750
But because you are so foolish, I think I can trust you.

08:40.650 --> 08:41.440
Trust?

08:42.130 --> 08:43.100
Let's make a deal.

08:43.640 --> 08:47.190
If you promise to use our bargaining chip for us...

08:47.590 --> 08:49.190
We will help you get out of here.

08:50.330 --> 08:51.810
What is this bargaining chip?

08:52.670 --> 08:55.660
Herman wrote to us and sent us letters.

08:57.220 --> 08:57.930
Does that mean...

08:58.380 --> 08:58.950
Yes.

08:59.410 --> 09:02.400
If read, all of Herman's schemes will be exposed.

09:03.760 --> 09:05.090
That's right.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.760
The letters are hidden in a certain place.

09:08.180 --> 09:09.760
Take them to the police.

09:10.180 --> 09:12.250
And then come back to help us.

09:12.890 --> 09:14.370
I understand. It's a promise.

09:14.840 --> 09:15.910
Where are they hidden?

09:18.720 --> 09:19.310
So then...

09:20.500 --> 09:21.480
Damn it!

09:22.080 --> 09:24.150
They hid something like that...

09:29.530 --> 09:30.570
A little more...

09:33.530 --> 09:34.890
Just a little more.

09:41.880 --> 09:43.530
We're counting on you, Nadja.

09:43.930 --> 09:44.320
Right!

09:47.600 --> 09:49.010
Surely she'll be alright.

09:49.380 --> 09:51.160
Because she's Nadja.

09:59.430 --> 10:03.030
At the west corner, there is a statue of a unicorn.

10:03.450 --> 10:04.740
Dig under there.

10:16.340 --> 10:16.930
Alright.

10:18.710 --> 10:19.900
Good job.

10:22.290 --> 10:22.930
Herman!

10:23.250 --> 10:24.560
Now, give that to me.

10:24.880 --> 10:25.380
No!

10:26.880 --> 10:27.720
You can't get away!

10:27.920 --> 10:28.610
Hand it over!

10:29.080 --> 10:29.840
No!

10:30.120 --> 10:30.780
Let me go!

10:30.780 --> 10:31.330
Damnit.

10:31.570 --> 10:32.610
Be obedient!

10:32.810 --> 10:33.870
No...!

10:43.840 --> 10:44.880
My...

10:45.550 --> 10:47.670
A cut on my face...

10:48.780 --> 10:50.040
That brat...!

10:54.090 --> 10:55.450
Wait!

11:04.650 --> 11:07.300
Above all, you are at fault, Nadja!

11:07.720 --> 11:08.830
If it weren't for you...

11:09.100 --> 11:12.680
Father would have given me the wealth of the Dukedom!

11:15.910 --> 11:16.800
You know...

11:17.240 --> 11:21.610
When I was a brat, Father raised me rigidly to become the successor of the Dukedom.

11:22.010 --> 11:24.770
Not allowed to play or rest...

11:25.560 --> 11:28.330
"So that you will become a suitable successor," he said.

11:28.530 --> 11:30.600
Even though I went through such painful things...

11:31.140 --> 11:34.010
When I became an adult and cut loose a little...

11:34.380 --> 11:38.010
Father said he would not allow me to become the successor!

11:38.430 --> 11:40.600
Searching for the child of my sister...

11:41.070 --> 11:43.270
Waiting to make her the successor...!

11:44.700 --> 11:45.540
There!?

11:53.880 --> 11:55.440
It's over, Nadja!

12:26.150 --> 12:27.260
Hey, Nadja!

12:27.480 --> 12:28.150
It's been a while!

12:29.310 --> 12:30.440
Everyone!

12:51.620 --> 12:52.370
Hey!

12:52.640 --> 12:53.480
Let me out!

12:54.190 --> 12:57.900
To make me, Duke Preminger's son, go through such circumstances...

12:58.090 --> 12:59.820
What are you thinking!?

13:06.210 --> 13:07.700
F-father...

13:08.070 --> 13:09.790
You came for an interview, right?

13:10.210 --> 13:13.670
Please tell them to release me as soon as possible.

13:14.260 --> 13:18.310
I have read the letters you sent to Rosso and Bianco.

13:21.250 --> 13:22.680
No, it's a misunderstanding...

13:22.800 --> 13:24.430
T-those are...

13:24.710 --> 13:28.160
Right, it's something that Rosso and Bianco made up.

13:28.410 --> 13:31.520
They have been jealous of my nobility so...

13:35.890 --> 13:38.230
If Rosso and Bianco's letters are not enough...

13:38.630 --> 13:41.000
Then what about the letter you sent to me?

13:41.760 --> 13:42.800
W-wait...!

13:43.910 --> 13:49.170
The assets of the Preminger Dukedom will soon become mine to do with as I please.

13:49.640 --> 13:54.080
Please wait to settle the debt until then.

13:56.530 --> 13:59.690
I have repaid the full sum of the debt.

13:59.810 --> 14:03.050
In exchange, I will completely cut all relations from you.

14:03.290 --> 14:05.270
We are no longer father and son.

14:05.910 --> 14:06.820
Forever.

14:21.190 --> 14:22.330
Ahh...

14:22.820 --> 14:26.200
It's much more comfortable here than at Herman's prison.

14:26.770 --> 14:28.250
A proper meal always comes...

14:28.600 --> 14:30.030
Perhaps even a dessert!

14:30.370 --> 14:30.840
Yeah.

14:31.630 --> 14:32.670
Thank goodness, right?

14:33.110 --> 14:34.870
Nadja kept her promise.

14:35.680 --> 14:38.230
I understood that she would definitely keep her promise.

14:38.720 --> 14:42.670
She is naive and is someone who trusts people immediately.

14:43.510 --> 14:47.160
But I can appreciate her good spiritedness.

14:47.630 --> 14:48.990
She is reliable.

14:49.780 --> 14:50.640
Hey, brother.

14:51.040 --> 14:56.320
If we ever get out of here, let's never work for an unsavory person like Herman again.

14:56.940 --> 14:58.100
Of course not!

14:58.350 --> 15:01.830
We will find a cash cow and make a great deal with them.

15:01.930 --> 15:03.280
Sounds like fun.

15:09.830 --> 15:15.650
Due to Herman's arrest, we have confirmed that the brooch is something that was originally stolen by him.

15:16.150 --> 15:20.910
So then, you recognize that Nadja is the real owner of the brooch?

15:21.580 --> 15:22.610
That's correct.

15:23.530 --> 15:24.510
Thank goodness.

15:24.980 --> 15:33.080
Besides, Oscar of the Colrad House was requested that it not count as a crime that you entered the mansion.

15:34.220 --> 15:35.080
That means...

15:35.670 --> 15:36.860
You are being released.

15:37.130 --> 15:40.490
Lord Francis Harcourt, there is no excuse for the trouble we have given you.

15:41.030 --> 15:42.860
We are very sorry.

15:45.770 --> 15:46.540
Keith...

15:47.420 --> 15:49.230
It all went according to plan.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.080
Thank you.

15:58.930 --> 15:59.740
Antonio!

16:00.160 --> 16:01.740
You seem well, Nadja.

16:02.040 --> 16:04.430
Did you come to this place to get your debts repaid?

16:04.930 --> 16:10.260
Thanks to you, Herman's debt was repaid by Duke Preminger.

16:10.950 --> 16:13.740
You'll lend money to anyone, right?

16:14.330 --> 16:15.070
How terrible!

16:15.270 --> 16:16.410
It's my job.

16:16.880 --> 16:20.430
But now that you've become a young noblewoman...

16:20.780 --> 16:23.590
How about it? There's a good story behind it.

16:23.840 --> 16:25.120
Are you interested?

16:25.740 --> 16:26.750
I'm not interested!

16:27.420 --> 16:28.110
Is that so?

16:29.440 --> 16:32.060
Well if you change your mind, please contact me.

16:32.210 --> 16:33.760
I won't change my mind!

16:35.840 --> 16:36.630
Jeeze!

16:39.270 --> 16:44.030
Well then, time to get back to mamma mia and eat some minestrone.

16:49.710 --> 16:50.500
Francis!

16:51.960 --> 16:52.700
Nadja!

16:52.820 --> 16:53.660
Francis!

16:54.300 --> 16:55.020
Francis...

16:55.310 --> 16:56.230
Francis...!

16:57.440 --> 16:58.080
Nadja...

16:58.650 --> 16:59.590
Francis...

17:08.770 --> 17:09.760
Nadja...

17:09.980 --> 17:11.630
Who is that...?

17:11.980 --> 17:14.500
You three really are pitiful.

17:14.870 --> 17:16.640
Good for you, Nadja!

17:16.990 --> 17:19.140
Now she can finally meet her mother, right?

17:19.430 --> 17:21.190
She's come a long way.

17:21.660 --> 17:24.100
But...it will be farewell soon.

17:24.250 --> 17:27.010
Nadja is a noble princess, after all.

17:27.410 --> 17:29.010
It will get lonely...

17:29.680 --> 17:30.450
Yeah...

17:32.050 --> 17:32.570
Nadja.

17:33.010 --> 17:35.380
Now that you will be recognized as the real Nadja...

17:35.750 --> 17:38.220
Let's go see Duke Preminger at once!

17:38.520 --> 17:38.910
Right!

17:43.360 --> 17:44.740
Princess Rosemary...

17:45.550 --> 17:51.060
I don't know any other princess more sublimely beautiful than you.

17:53.210 --> 17:57.380
But it will soon be farewell...Princess Rosemary.

18:09.650 --> 18:11.500
I was waiting for you, Nadja.

18:15.180 --> 18:17.720
Rosemary, how could you do something so horrible...

18:18.240 --> 18:21.520
Even though we were raised at Applefield Orphanage...

18:22.190 --> 18:24.140
I thought of you as important family!

18:24.560 --> 18:27.790
I thought that would never change!

18:28.440 --> 18:30.580
You thought it would never change?

18:31.520 --> 18:34.530
That's right, Nadja. You haven't changed.

18:35.180 --> 18:36.810
However, I have changed.

18:37.050 --> 18:38.760
I'm not the same person as before.

18:39.100 --> 18:39.470
Eh?

18:40.190 --> 18:43.370
After Applefield, I went out into the wide world.

18:43.590 --> 18:44.480
And I understood.

18:45.300 --> 18:48.460
You won't get anywhere if you just have dreams.

18:49.420 --> 18:53.270
You have to stretch out your arm and grasp the things you want with your own hands.

18:53.640 --> 18:55.370
To stretch out your own arm...

18:55.940 --> 18:58.330
So then it's alright to take other people's things?

18:58.650 --> 19:01.120
That it's alright to lie and deceive everyone?

19:01.620 --> 19:02.280
That...

19:02.780 --> 19:04.480
That is wrong!

19:07.790 --> 19:10.060
Yes...I was wrong.

19:12.330 --> 19:15.520
I understood it by living as a noble for a little while.

19:16.260 --> 19:18.080
That they are dull.

19:20.080 --> 19:22.700
I thought that if I could become a noble princess...

19:23.070 --> 19:25.390
I would be free in every respect.

19:25.910 --> 19:30.970
To wear beautiful dresses every day, to go to parties and have fun.

19:32.180 --> 19:34.060
But reality was different.

19:34.770 --> 19:37.170
Customs, parentage, traditions...

19:38.400 --> 19:40.970
They were constraining things.

19:43.860 --> 19:47.240
Herman said that he couldn't inherit and that he was struggling...

19:48.030 --> 19:50.670
And the Duke who thinks about nothing but his House...

19:52.130 --> 19:55.090
When I think about associating with those people forever...

19:55.430 --> 19:56.500
I'm already fed up with it.

19:57.290 --> 19:59.460
Really, nobles are good for nothing.

20:00.100 --> 20:02.100
There are different kinds of nobles.

20:02.620 --> 20:05.930
Those who see people in trouble and do their best to help them.

20:06.840 --> 20:08.320
I hate those kind of speeches.

20:09.040 --> 20:10.320
Don't say that!

20:10.990 --> 20:15.630
Nadja, we are living in a new era now, the 20th century.

20:16.070 --> 20:20.640
I understand that from now on, a princess won't be a noble's daughter anymore.

20:21.430 --> 20:22.100
Therefore...

20:22.620 --> 20:24.420
